mail.verify.body:
Hello {name},

To confirm that {email} is yours, open this link:

{link}

It works for 48 hours. If you didn’t ask for it, you can ignore this message.

{app}

mail.reset.body:
Hello {name},

Someone —hopefully you— asked for a new password for the {app} account “{username}”. To choose one, open this link:

{link}

It works for one hour and only once. If it wasn’t you, ignore this message: your password stays as it is.

{app}

mail.invite.body:
Hello,

{inviter} has invited you to {app}. To create your account, open this link:

{link}

It works for 7 days.

{app}
